e princess worked in the rosegarden from 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock to tidy it up.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The rosegarden lost all its life in winter.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"When spring arrived, the rosegarden turned back to life and color.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"But once spring arrived, it turned back to life and color\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The rose garden was the private property of the royal family.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"the rose garden was the private property of the royal family\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"the young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People from all over the country traveled to the castel to wander through the rosegarden.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"During that time, people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw it.\",\n      \"line\": 22,\n      \"span\": \"everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Visitors to the rosegarden sent the postcard to their home.\",\n      \"line\": 22,\n      \"span\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People made bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People and postcards were usually transported in the same carriage.\",\n      \"line\": 24,\n      \"span\": \"the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"An old lady lived in a forest.\",\n      \"line\": 28,\n      \"span\": \"there was an old lady that lived in a dark, spooky forest\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The forest was not traversable between October and April.\",\n      \"line\": 32,\n      \"span\": \"The forest was not traversable between October and April\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The old lady lived the entire year in the forest.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"The old lady nevertheless lived the entire year in the forest\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Over the years, the old lady acclimated to the weather.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"Over the years, she acclimated to the weather\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The old lady built strategies to survive.\",\n      \"line\": 33,\n      \"span\": \"she built strategies to survive the harsh conditions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The old lady collected wild herbs.\",\n      \"line\": 37,\n      \"span\": \"Instead of harvesting skulls and bones, she collected wild herbs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The old lady sold wild herbs to wandering travelers, who transported and sold them to cities.\",\n      \"line\": 38,\n      \"span\": \"Those wild herbs were tried and sold to wandering travelers who transported and sold the herbs into the cities\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A young man traveled to the old lady's house in the woods.\",\n      \"line\": 42,\n      \"span\": \"one young man took the courage and traveled to the old lady's house deep in the woods\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"It took the young man days to reach the old lady's house.\",\n      \"line\": 43,\n      \"span\": \"It took him days to reach her house\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young man struggled with wet and slippery ground.\",\n      \"line\": 43,\n      \"span\": \"he struggled with the wet and slippery ground\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young man lost his orientation several times.\",\n      \"line\": 43,\n      \"span\": \"He also lost his orientation several times\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young man reached the old lady's house.\",\n      \"line\": 44,\n      \"span\": \"But eventually, he reached her house\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young man knocked on the door.\",\n      \"line\": 44,\n      \"span\": \"He carefully knocked\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The old lady opened the door, saw the young man, and asked him to enter her house, sit at the fire, and drink hot soup.\",\n      \"line\": 45,\n      \"span\": \"When she opened the door and saw the young man, she asked him to come into her house, sit at the fire and drink some hot soup she made for him\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The old lady gave the man medicine made from herbs she collected in spring for the entire village.\",\n      \"line\": 49,\n      \"span\": \"When the man recovered again, she gave him enough medicine made out of the herbs she collected in spring for the entire village\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young man returned to his village and provided medicine to every sick person as instructed by the old lady.\",\n      \"line\": 50,\n      \"span\": \"He traveled back to his village and went to the home of every sick person to provide them with the correct amount of medicine as told by the old lady from the woods\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Everyone in the village got healthy again.\",\n      \"line\": 51,\n      \"span\": \"Eventually, everyone got healthy again\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The villagers sent a huge basket of cheese and dried meat to the old lady every autumn so she could feast in winter.\",\n      \"line\": 51,\n      \"span\": \"from then on the villagers sent a huge basket of cheese and dried meat to the old lady every autumn so that she could feast in winter\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":155254,"type":"result","duration_ms":166649,"uuid":"3dca27f4-f27e-4729-b299-7c2e94a8557a","ttft_stream_ms":653,"time_to_request_ms":115,"first_content_frame_ms":654,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
